    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehoahazi ntemi wa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba mu sī yenīyo būnsola Yehoahazi ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yosia, būntūūla kūbiza ntemi ū mu Yelusalemu a ha ng'wanya go ng'wa ise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yehoahazi walī na myaka makūmi abīlī n'idatū aho alībiza ntemi. Ūsuga ū mu Yelusalemu ikanza lya myeji idatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū ntemi wa Misili wiza ūntyūūla a h'isumbī lya būtemi; hanuma a banhū ba Yuda ūbatūūlīla goodi ya kūfunya feza ja būdito wa tani idatū na nusu, na zahabu ja būdito wa kilo makūmi adatū n'inè. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi wa Misili ūntūūla Eliakimu nkūlūye o ng'wa Yehoahazi a ha būtemi wa Yuda na Yelusalemu, nī lina lyakwe ī lya Eliakimu ūngalūcha, ūbiza Yehoyakimu. Alīyo ū Neko ūnsola ū nzunaye o ng'wa Eliakimu ū Yehoahazi ūja nang'hwe Misili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehoyakimu ntemi wa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yehoyakimu aho alībiza ntemi wa Yuda walī na myaka makūmi abīlī n'ītanò, ūsuga ikanza lya myaka ikūmi na gūmò alī mu Yelusalemu. Nang'hwe wīta yabūbi ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA, ū Mulungu wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebukadineza ntemi wa Babuloni wiza kūndumīla, ūntunga nhendele ja shaba ūntwala Babuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Nebukadineza ūbūūcha na shiseme shimò na shimò sha mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA, ūja nasho Babuloni, ūūkashitūūla ng'wikūlū lyakwe kwenūko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mihayo yīngī ī ya mu shikū ja būtemi bo ng'wa Yehoyakimu, ī ya malofu īyo akīīta, nī yīyo akamanika alī nayo, yandīkilwe mu shitabo sha batemi ba Isilaeli na Yuda. Ng'witūnja wakwe Yehoyachini ūbiza ntemi a ha ng'wanya gwakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehoyachini ntemi wa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yehoyachini aho alībiza ntemi walī na myaka ikūmi n'īnaane, ūsuga ikanza lya myeji idatū na shikū ikūmi alī mu Yelusalemu. Nang'hwe wīta yabūbi ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho gwajīlīīla kūshila ū ng'waka, ū ntemi Nebukadineza ūnagīja ū Yehoachini kūja Babuloni, ūja hamò na shiseme shimò na shimò sha mpango ntaale ī sha kafuma mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA. Hanuma ūnsola ise ndo o ng'wa Yehoyachini, lina lyakwe Zedekia, ūntūūla kūbiza ntemi wa Yuda na Yelusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Zedekia ntemi wa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Zedekia aho alībiza ntemi walī na myaka makūmi abīlī na gūmò, ūsuga ikanza lya myaka ikūmi na gūmò alī mu Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wīta yabūbi ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA, ū Mulungu wakwe; ūlema nū kwidoohya ū kūlī ng'hangi Yelemia aho wang'wīla mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū ntemi Nebukadineza ūngomela, alīyo walī wang'wilahīja mu lina lya ng'wa Mulungu; nīyo ūbiza na ntwe diimu no, nī ng'holò yakwe wīgang'hanaja, ūlema gete ū kūngalūkīla ū SEEBA, ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama hangī a higūlya ya henaho, a batongeeji na bagabīji na a banhū bose bongeja no ū kūbiza bashitiigwa, nguno bashimīzīlaga mu shītīle sha banhū ba mahanga, bīsosohaja ī hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA, īyo SEEBA walī wīyeeja ū mu Yelusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūgwa kwa Yelusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ū Mulungu wa bakūlūgenji babo ng'hangala ningī wabatūmaga batūmami bakwe kūbahūgūla a banhū bakwe, nguno walī abasaatilwe hamò nī hekalu yakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo babineenelegejaga dūhū a batūmami ba ng'wa Mulungu, kūnū bakwīdalahaga ī mihayo yakwe, na a bahangi bakwe bakūbasekaga; kūshisha nose ū būpelanu bo ng'wa SEEBA būbapembekela a banhū bakwe, yūbiza ītīho nzīla ya kūbapīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbatūmīla ntemi wa Bakalidayo; aho washika ūyūbabūlaga a bitūnja babo bo shū, na a babo baalī mu numba yabo ya kūpīlīla. Atachīlile shigongo munhū nūūlū ūmò; abize nsūmba, munhya, namhala nūūlū ngikūlū, nūūlū abize wakūla na kinehe, pye a bose ū SEEBA ūbatūūla mu makono ga ng'wa Nebukadineza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shiseme sha mu hekalu ya ng'wa Mulungu ūshibūūcha pyī ūja nasho Babuloni; ī shose shitaale na shido, pyī nī sabo ījo jalī mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA, nī ja ntemi, nī ja batūmami bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma bītiima moto ī hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA, ī ndugu ya Yelusalemu bīhilimīkīja; ī numba ja h'ikūlū būjikūbīka moto pyī, nīyo būlī shikolo sha mpango būshikenaagūla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo bakalekeelwa ū kūbūlagwa bo shū ūbatunga ūbajana Babuloni, būūkabiza basese bakwe na ba bitūnja bakwe, kūshisha ikanza lya būsugi wa Baajemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ī sī yūbiza mu shikū ja Sabato ja kwifuula kwayo; yūlembeela ī likanza ī lyose īlo yalī buyīkī. Yifuula kūshisha yūshikīīla ī myaka makūmi mpungūdī, gīt'ūmo gwalī gwahayīla ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA ūyo akagūhaya mu nzīla ya ng'wa Yelemia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ntemi Koleshi kūbinha wiyaabī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ng'waka go ng'wa Koleshi kwandya kūbiza ntemi wa Būajemi, ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA ūyo gwalī gwahayiwa na Yelemia gūkashikīlījiwa. Ū SEEBA wīyīta ī ng'holò ya ng'wa Koleshi ū ntemi wa Būajemi kūbiza na ng'hūmbū ja kūfunya shilagīlo hose pyī ū mu būsugi bokwe; hūna ūshandīka alīhaya: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
